{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-4-5-20250929","id":"msg_011Cf6KmewkSJUMHpGdr8CvQ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Done! I've added the new endpoint GET `/api/tags/popular` to the RealWorld/Conduit backend.\n\n## Summary\n\nThe endpoint returns the ten most-used tags across all articles, ordered by usage count (descending), in the exact JSON format requested:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"tags\": [\n    { \"name\": \"javascript\", \"count\": 42 },\n    { \"name\": \"typescript\", \"count\": 35 },\n    ...\n  ]\n}\n```\n\nThe implementation:\n- Uses Prisma's `_count` aggregation to efficiently count articles per tag\n- Orders by article count descending and limits to 10 results\n- Follows the existing TypeScript + Express + Prisma architecture\n- Places the more specific route before the general `/tags` route (Express best practice)\n- Is already registered through the existing `tagsRouter` import chain\n\n## Files changed\n\n1. **src/routes/tags.ts** - Added the new `/tags/popular` endpoint (lines 6-29)"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":8,"cache_creation_input_tokens":818,"cache_read_input_tokens":34100,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":818},"output_tokens":4,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"4e38d07f-00ac-4f6d-b185-2bf9410d7322","uuid":"73cd4287-40fa-4b52-977f-2a2c43b4d3ed","timestamp":"2026-09-16T02:24:40.978Z","request_id":"req_011Cf6KmeVhUiWyLYKQYMq9i"}
